\label{thm:xi:exact-adequacy}
The following are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\roman*)]
  \item \(\Xi_C(D\mid L)=0\);
  \item \(D_0=A_*L_0\);
  \item there exists a linear map \(A\colon Y\to Z\) such that \(D_0=AL_0\);
  \item \(\Ker L_0\subseteq \Ker D_0\).
\end{enumerate}

